#   computed_properties_1 - ComputedProperties: the property store and its basic readers
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/ComputedProperties.cpp (lines 1-422) and the inline members of
#       ComputedProperties.h: construction, the per-longhand value array and its important,
#       inherited and animation flags, the animated values, `property()`, and the first typed
#       readers (sizes, gaps, lengths, length boxes, colors, positions, coordinated value lists,
#       color-interpolation, color-scheme, the fallback font, line-height, z-index, opacity).
